212
00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.776
Go back to sleep.

213
00:19:10.859 --> 00:19:12.027
Now.

214
00:19:24.957 --> 00:19:26.959
<i>Apْrate. Carajo.</i>

215
00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.968
There?

216
00:20:00.158 --> 00:20:02.160
Thanks.

217
